<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Shell palette. These are Material 3 semantic roles for the app chrome:
  the chooser, the toolbars, the settings screens, and the help screen.

  The game board palette is not here. It comes from game_props.xml and
  from the colours in colors.xml, and it is part of parity.

  The screen sections of docs/DESIGN.md apply: one accent, neutral
  surfaces, contrast of at least 4.5:1 for text and 3:1 for UI.
-->
